      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEEKY STREAK (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.54) at this track behind Don't Confess in a T3 Grade 6. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Top chance in this line up. BAMBI'S PRIDE (3) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing fourth (22.65) at this track latest. Solid record here winning two races. Likely to be thereabouts. DIMORA STRIPEY (7) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage third, beaten 5.5 lengths (23.12) at Geelong in a Rank Limit - Grade 6 over 400m. Expected to feature again. RUMBLING ROSE (6) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
